155
00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.880
It was very funny.

156
00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:49.700
Everyone's at the top of their game in this quick little scene.

157
00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:55.480
I could not look at Creed when he started asking about who's your OBGYN.

158
00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:56.160
I know.

159
00:06:56.360 --> 00:06:56.800
I know.

160
00:06:56.860 --> 00:06:57.440
It's so funny.

161
00:06:58.220 --> 00:06:58.640
All right.

162
00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.740
Everybody will please enjoy your second drink of gossip.

163
00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:07.000
