00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:09.240
Parkour!

544
00:22:09.340 --> 00:22:09.960
Oh, my God.

545
00:22:10.180 --> 00:22:10.520
Parkour!

546
00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:10.800
Oh, God.

547
00:22:11.000 --> 00:22:11.240
Stop.

548
00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:12.020
Stop.

549
00:22:12.420 --> 00:22:12.740
Stop.

550
00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:16.840
You guys, she pushed off from the table and shook all the microphones.

