00:22:17.020 --> 00:22:22.280
Then she ran over to the wall, and I want to say about two feet high, put her foot on the wall, and jumped.

552
00:22:22.280 --> 00:22:22.640
I'm out of breath.

553
00:22:23.100 --> 00:22:24.040
I'm out of breath.

