00:25:54.210 --> 00:25:55.770
Meredith's deodorant spray.

617
00:25:56.390 --> 00:26:01.030
A wooden ladder, boxes, wooden pallets, dumpster, trash bins in the parking lot.

618
00:26:01.470 --> 00:26:03.970
And then as we get into the episode, there's so many more.

