00:26:58.170 --> 00:26:59.570
the Vance refrigeration truck.

638
00:26:59.570 --> 00:27:10.090
And then one at 1 minute 14 seconds, showing the back of, quote-unquote, Andy as he jumps

639
00:27:10.090 --> 00:27:11.890
off the truck.

640
00:27:12.150 --> 00:27:12.570
So good.

641
00:27:12.810 --> 00:27:14.530
These are the little details I love.

