00:28:49.970 --> 00:28:51.710
They only did two takes.

674
00:28:51.710 --> 00:28:54.490
And they used the first one in editing.

675
00:28:54.910 --> 00:28:55.810
He nailed it.

676
00:28:55.950 --> 00:28:56.610
Nailed it.

