It was one of the first jobs I ever got in Hollywood.

767
00:33:07.310 --> 00:33:12.790
I was well aware of the show and a huge fan of both the British version and the American version.

768
00:33:12.790 --> 00:33:16.570
So, it was a dream come true.

769
00:33:17.670 --> 00:33:22.570
So, Angela, when I hear his voice in that audio clip, that is exactly how I remember him on set.

770
00:33:22.730 --> 00:33:24.830
He was just kind and...

